{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Өлгөн сайын артынан,", "en": "After each one died, in pursuit,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Өлгөн сайын артынан,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Өзүм кыраар эрчиткен,", "en": "I myself led those who would strike them down,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word appears to be эрчиткен; the middle word may instead be кырлар.", "bbox": null, "text": "Өзүм кыраар эрчиткен,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Табалайбы арбан балы тоң,", "en": "[Uncertain: will they find the cart-load, frozen?]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "All four word shapes are visible, but the phrase is not securely intelligible; арбан and балы may be different lexemes.", "bbox": null, "text": "Табалайбы арбан балы тоң,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Мунун баатырлыгы дагы чоң.", "en": "His heroism is great as well.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Мунун баатырлыгы дагы чоң."}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Көзү көрдү аныктап,", "en": "His own eyes saw it clearly,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Көзү көрдү аныктап,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Эң биринчи даанышман,", "en": "The foremost sage,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Эң биринчи даанышман,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Жер жүзүнө жарыша,", "en": "Racing across the face of the earth,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Жер жүзүнө жарыша,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Жеке чыгар жарыштан,", "en": "He would emerge alone from the race,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Жеке чыгар жарыштан,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Төрт күлүгү шай болду,", "en": "His four racehorses were ready,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first two words are pale and may have a different reading; күлүгү is inferred from the racing context.", "bbox": null, "text": "Төрт күлүгү шай болду,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Төрө алган Сайкалдан,", "en": "From Saykal, whom the prince had taken,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle word is difficult; it resembles алган, while the final proper name reads Сайкалдан.", "bbox": null, "text": "Төрө алган Сайкалдан,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Артыма түшкөн жан болду.", "en": "There was a soul who followed behind me.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Артыма түшкөн жан болду."}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Эки жайлоого кондуруп,", "en": "Settling them on two summer pastures,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Эки жайлоого кондуруп,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Кочуштаган көп элби,", "en": "Was it the multitude that migrated?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is a best-effort reading of a compressed cursive form; the line may instead contain көчүшкөн.", "bbox": null, "text": "Кочуштаган көп элби,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Эркин менен болдумун,", "en": "I lived in freedom,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Эркин менен болдумун,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Эл жыргатып жүрдү күлүп,", "en": "Delighting the people, he went laughing,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "жүрдү күлүп is the likely reading, but several letters overlap and are faint.", "bbox": null, "text": "Эл жыргатып жүрдү күлүп,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Эл короосу болду эле,", "en": "He had become the people's enclosure and refuge,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Эл короосу болду эле,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Баатырдыгы, шердиги,", "en": "His heroism, his lionhearted courage,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Баатырдыгы, шердиги,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Көктөмдөй таңдай тийди эми,", "en": "Now it struck the palate like springtime,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first two words remain unresolved at lexical level; this is a letter-shape transcription and the English is provisional.", "bbox": null, "text": "Көктөмдөй таңдай тийди эми,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Айбаттанып чаңырса,", "en": "If he roared fearsomely,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final verb resembles чаңырса, but could be a closely related formula involving чаң.", "bbox": null, "text": "Айбаттанып чаңырса,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Арстандай көзү кызарып,", "en": "His eyes reddening like a lion's,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Арстандай көзү кызарып,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Жаадай оозун кусалы,", "en": "[Uncertain: his mouth like a bow ...]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Жаадай and оозун are plausible; the final word is not securely deciphered and the line cannot be translated confidently.", "bbox": null, "text": "Жаадай оозун кусалы,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Ай талаага узарып,", "en": "Stretching out across the open steppe,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Ай талаага узарып,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Жан жолдошуң жүз болуп,", "en": "With a hundred close companions,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The possessive ending in жолдошуң and the numeral жүз are the likeliest readings, though both are cursively compressed.", "bbox": null, "text": "Жан жолдошуң жүз болуп,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Жороолору эр болуп,", "en": "His comrades were brave men,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Жороолору эр болуп,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Кайнап күлкүлүк тең болуп,", "en": "[Uncertain: seething, equal in merriment,]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The line is fully visible but its second and third lexical forms are not secure; English follows the tentative reading.", "bbox": null, "text": "Кайнап күлкүлүк тең болуп,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Кара мылтык карс этсе,", "en": "When a black gun cracked,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Кара мылтык карс этсе,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Качпай турган эр Кенен,", "en": "Brave Kenen, who would not flee,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Качпай турган эр Кенен,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Чоң мылтык тарс этсе,", "en": "When a great gun boomed,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is heavily cursive and may be another adjective; мылтык тарс этсе is clear.", "bbox": null, "text": "Чоң мылтык тарс этсе,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Чочуп кетпес шер Кенен,", "en": "Lionhearted Kenen would not startle and flee,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Чочуп кетпес шер Кенен,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Айбаты артып, заары курч,", "en": "His majesty mounting, his wrath sharp,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "This is a contextual normalization of difficult cursive; артып and курч are not fully secure on letter shape alone.", "bbox": null, "text": "Айбаты артып, заары курч,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Асыл Кенен көк жалдан,", "en": "Noble Kenen, the gray-maned wolf,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null, "text": "Асыл Кенен көк жалдан,"}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf007:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 7, "folio": 390, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Артыгыраак тең келин,", "en": "[Uncertain: come as a somewhat superior equal,]", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final baseline is fully visible but remains lexically unresolved; this is the closest letter-shape reading.", "bbox": null, "text": "Артыгыраак тең келин,"}
